{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Primeval Genesis</strong> is a third-person, hobbyist-built, narrative-driven survival shooter set on a remote island where prehistoric life has been brought back through experimental science. You play as Cole, a quiet and reserved prior service member hired on a contracted assignment by a shadowy corporation to provide security and ranger services.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What begins to appear as a quiet vacation of a job quickly spirals into chaos as strange events unfold on the secluded island and unseen threats begin to emerge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive against deadly dinosaurs, hostile creatures, conspiratorial human factions, and the island\u2019s stark contrast of dense jungle and industrial decay. Piece together the clues scattered across brutalist research labs, chemical storage sites, and crumbling power stations\u2014assisted by your training officer and sarcastic, battle-hardened brit, Vinny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This handcrafted single-player experience, created by a small team in Unreal Engine 4, seeks to blend environmental storytelling, cinematic gameplay, tension, and grounded science fiction to deliver a gripping and atmospheric story with an unsettling but wonderous backdrop.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Functional Enemies</strong><br>Enemies are built to think, hunt, and attack. Raptors ambush in large tactical teams, Rexes overpower with brute force and chase relentlessly, Pteranodons strike from above, and human adversaries aim for the chinks in the armor. Watch as Raptors take down a roaming Stegosaurus from a safe distance, bait a rex into a crowd of hostiles and watch the action unfold chaotically as Cole.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785140/extras/5007c3383adc8d929423ba6fd0aff89e.poster.avif?t=1761449855\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785140/extras/5007c3383adc8d929423ba6fd0aff89e.webm?t=1761449855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785140/extras/5007c3383adc8d929423ba6fd0aff89e.mp4?t=1761449855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Environmental Puzzles</strong><br>Survive hastily built, crumbling industrial infrastructure and lush ecosystems by navigating outdated machinery, rerouting power, and bypassing hazardous zones filled with many a danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785140/extras/4ce03ba3d9a5828ef502a6f1ddc7ed11.poster.avif?t=1761449855\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785140/extras/4ce03ba3d9a5828ef502a6f1ddc7ed11.webm?t=1761449855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785140/extras/4ce03ba3d9a5828ef502a6f1ddc7ed11.mp4?t=1761449855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude99 <strong>Vehicles</strong><br>Ride alongside NPC controlled partners\u2014or take the wheel yourself\u2014as you speed through many semi-open levels as well as linear levels across wide plains, dense jungles, and collapsing sectors of industrial decay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785140/extras/af1545dd5c5ab2fd536ba054d25af0c9.poster.avif?t=1761449855\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785140/extras/af1545dd5c5ab2fd536ba054d25af0c9.webm?t=1761449855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785140/extras/af1545dd5c5ab2fd536ba054d25af0c9.mp4?t=1761449855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf92 <strong>Inventory and Items</strong> <br>Use tools in real-time to turn the tide: auto-injectors for healing, flares to distract massive predators, or sound traps to sneak past patrols undetected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcd3 <strong>Environmental Storytelling</strong><br>Uncover the fate of the facility\u2019s staff through scattered journal entries, destroyed rooms, and haunting audio logs left behind in their final hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfac <strong>Cinematic-Focused Gameplay</strong><br>Story-driven sequences, reactive dialogue, and radio-based NPC communication deliver a tight, cinematic experience that supports immersion without dragging control away from the player.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3785140?t=1761449855","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785140/250f508ae709e3a5b42dda8d7cffb01e23a926c9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761449855","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785140/0cd73c28afeb417dd5066bbab04becd55e11f664/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761449855","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785140/0cd73c28afeb417dd5066bbab04becd55e11f664/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761449855","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Primeval Genesis contains frequent depictions of violence, including intense combat against humans and prehistoric creatures, blood effects, and death animations. The game also includes dark thematic elements such as corporate negligence, isolation, and survival in hostile environments.\r\n\r\nWhile there is no sexual content, players should be aware of mature themes such as injury, death, psychological stress, and references to human experimentation. Some scenes may be intense or frightening."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Primeval Genesis</strong> is a third-person, hobbyist-built, narrative-driven survival shooter set on a remote island where prehistoric life has been brought back through experimental science. You play as Cole, a quiet and reserved prior service member hired on a contracted assignment by a shadowy corporation to provide security and ranger services.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What begins to appear as a quiet vacation of a job quickly spirals into chaos as strange events unfold on the secluded island and unseen threats begin to emerge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive against deadly dinosaurs, hostile creatures, conspiratorial human factions, and the island\u2019s stark contrast of dense jungle and industrial decay. Piece together the clues scattered across brutalist research labs, chemical storage sites, and crumbling power stations\u2014assisted by your training officer and sarcastic, battle-hardened brit, Vinny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This handcrafted single-player experience, created by a small team in Unreal Engine 4, seeks to blend environmental storytelling, cinematic gameplay, tension, and grounded science fiction to deliver a gripping and atmospheric story with an unsettling but wonderous backdrop.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Functional Enemies</strong><br>Enemies are built to think, hunt, and attack. Raptors ambush in large tactical teams, Rexes overpower with brute force and chase relentlessly, Pteranodons strike from above, and human adversaries aim for the chinks in the armor. Watch as Raptors take down a roaming Stegosaurus from a safe distance, bait a rex into a crowd of hostiles and watch the action unfold chaotically as Cole.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785140/extras/5007c3383adc8d929423ba6fd0aff89e.poster.avif?t=1761449855\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785140/extras/5007c3383adc8d929423ba6fd0aff89e.webm?t=1761449855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785140/extras/5007c3383adc8d929423ba6fd0aff89e.mp4?t=1761449855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Environmental Puzzles</strong><br>Survive hastily built, crumbling industrial infrastructure and lush ecosystems by navigating outdated machinery, rerouting power, and bypassing hazardous zones filled with many a danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785140/extras/4ce03ba3d9a5828ef502a6f1ddc7ed11.poster.avif?t=1761449855\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785140/extras/4ce03ba3d9a5828ef502a6f1ddc7ed11.webm?t=1761449855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785140/extras/4ce03ba3d9a5828ef502a6f1ddc7ed11.mp4?t=1761449855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude99 <strong>Vehicles</strong><br>Ride alongside NPC controlled partners\u2014or take the wheel yourself\u2014as you speed through many semi-open levels as well as linear levels across wide plains, dense jungles, and collapsing sectors of industrial decay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785140/extras/af1545dd5c5ab2fd536ba054d25af0c9.poster.avif?t=1761449855\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785140/extras/af1545dd5c5ab2fd536ba054d25af0c9.webm?t=1761449855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785140/extras/af1545dd5c5ab2fd536ba054d25af0c9.mp4?t=1761449855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf92 <strong>Inventory and Items</strong> <br>Use tools in real-time to turn the tide: auto-injectors for healing, flares to distract massive predators, or sound traps to sneak past patrols undetected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcd3 <strong>Environmental Storytelling</strong><br>Uncover the fate of the facility\u2019s staff through scattered journal entries, destroyed rooms, and haunting audio logs left behind in their final hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfac <strong>Cinematic-Focused Gameplay</strong><br>Story-driven sequences, reactive dialogue, and radio-based NPC communication deliver a tight, cinematic experience that supports immersion without dragging control away from the player.</p>","developers":["After Hours Digital"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785140/a94bce192b0d329712d14132afa7d0b41521af0b/header.jpg?t=1761449855","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 After Hours Games. Primeval Genesis and all associated assets are the property of After Hours Games. All rights reserved. Unreal Engine 